{"id":65829,"date":"2026-09-02T20:28:58","date_gmt":"2026-09-02T19:28:58","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-10-28T14:10:50","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T13:10:50","slug":"meia-maratona-de-roma-roma-ostia","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-de-roma-roma-ostia\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona de Roma (Roma-Ostia) 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Meia Maratona de Roma (Roma-Ostia) 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Meia Maratona de Roma (Roma-Ostia) 2027<\/strong> (52\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da hist\u00f3rica <em>RomaOstia Half Marathon<\/em>) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>28 de fevereiro de 2027<\/strong>, com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0s 07:30 e partidas por vagas a partir das <strong>09:00<\/strong>. Inserida no calend\u00e1rio internacional da <strong>World Athletics<\/strong> e da <strong>FIDAL<\/strong>, \u00e9 a meia maratona mais participada e emblem\u00e1tica de <strong>It\u00e1lia<\/strong>, ligando a capital italiana \u00e0 costa do Mar Tirreno.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O percurso linear de <strong>21,097 km<\/strong> parte junto \u00e0 arquitetura monumental do <strong>PalaEUR<\/strong>, no bairro racionalista do EUR em <strong>Roma<\/strong>, e percorre a ampla <strong>Via Cristoforo Colombo<\/strong> \u2014 incluindo a famosa subida do <em>Camping<\/em> a meio da prova seguida de uma r\u00e1pida descida final \u2014 at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta instalada na <strong>Piazzale Cristoforo Colombo (Rotonda)<\/strong>, frente \u00e0 praia de <strong>Ostia<\/strong>. Com recorde da prova na casa dos 58:00, o tra\u00e7ado oferece condi\u00e7\u00f5es de excel\u00eancia para bateres o teu recorde pessoal nos 21,1 km.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong>GSBRun (Gruppo Sportivo Bancari Romani)<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>RCS Sports & Events<\/strong> e com o patroc\u00ednio de Roma Capitale e da Regione Lazio, a prova garante transporte gratuito de bagagem da partida para a meta (entrega at\u00e9 \u00e0s 07:45), <em>pacemakers<\/em> oficiais, tr\u00eas postos de abastecimento e levantamento de dorsais na aldeia <strong>Casa RomaOstia<\/strong>. Explora tamb\u00e9m o calend\u00e1rio das melhores <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/meia-maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Meias Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e prepara a tua prova na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Ritmo (Pace)<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">28 de Fevereiro de 2027 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">PalaEUR, Roma, It\u00e1lia<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">21,097 km (Meia Maratona)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">GSBRun (Gruppo Sportivo Bancari Romani) e RCS Sports & Events<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">3h30 (Km 10: 1h40 | Km 15: 2h30)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/romaostia.it\/regolamento\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\">\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Consultar Regulamento Oficial &rarr;\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li><div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas & Sub-eventos<\/strong><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Meia Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">RomaOstia Half Marathon (21,097 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 28 Fev \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 35,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 10\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 40,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 19\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 45,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 04\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 4:<\/strong> 50,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Meia Maratona de Roma (Roma-Ostia) 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 52\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>RomaOstia Half Marathon<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>28 de fevereiro de 2027<\/strong>, em Roma, It\u00e1lia. A concentra\u00e7\u00e3o no PalaEUR come\u00e7a \u00e0s 07:30 (com entrega de sacos de guarda-roupa at\u00e9 \u00e0s 07:45) e as partidas por ondas arrancam \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong> rumo \u00e0 Rotonda de Ostia (Piazzale Cristoforo Colombo).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite (cut-off) e o perfil do percurso de 21,097 km?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso de 21,097 km \u00e9 linear ao longo da Via Cristoforo Colombo, ligando o bairro do EUR ao Mar Tirreno. O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo \u00e9 de <strong>3h30<\/strong>, com duas barreiras hor\u00e1rias interm\u00e9dias: passagem ao <strong>km 10 at\u00e9 1h40<\/strong> e ao <strong>km 15 at\u00e9 2h30<\/strong>.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es encerram a <strong>15 de fevereiro de 2027<\/strong> e evoluem por fases: 35,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 10\/11\/2026, 40,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 19\/01\/2027, 45,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 04\/02\/2027 e 50,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 15\/02\/2027. O valor inclui camisola oficial de corrida, <em>gymbag<\/em>, saco numerado para transporte de bagagem e dorsal com chip.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os requisitos para atletas portugueses e estrangeiros?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os atletas residentes fora de It\u00e1lia podem participar apresentando filia\u00e7\u00e3o numa federa\u00e7\u00e3o nacional afiliada \u00e0 World Athletics, Runcard FIDAL com certificado m\u00e9dico, ou de forma simplificada no regime <strong>Tur\u00edstico-Desportivo<\/strong> (cidad\u00e3os estrangeiros n\u00e3o federados), bastando assinar o termo de responsabilidade (<em>liability waiver<\/em>) e submeter documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde \u00e9 levantado o dorsal e quem organiza a prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento do dorsal e <em>pacco gara<\/em> decorre exclusivamente nos dias anteriores \u00e0 prova na aldeia <strong>Casa RomaOstia<\/strong> (n\u00e3o h\u00e1 entrega no domingo de manh\u00e3). O evento \u00e9 organizado pelo <strong>GSBRun (Gruppo Sportivo Bancari Romani)<\/strong> e pela <strong>RCS Sports & Events<\/strong>, sob a \u00e9gide da World Athletics e da FIDAL.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Meia Maratona de Roma (Roma-Ostia) 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-28\", \"endDate\": \"2027-02-28\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Roma, It\u00e1lia\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"It\u00e1lia\", \"addressRegion\": \"It\u00e1lia\", \"addressCountry\": \"IT\"}}, \"description\": \"A 52\u00aa Meia Maratona de Roma (Roma-Ostia) 2027 realiza-se a 28 de fevereiro \u00e0s 09:00, de Roma (PalaEUR) at\u00e9 ao mar em Ostia. Consulta o guia e inscreve-te j\u00e1!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-meia-maratona-de-roma-roma-ostia.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"RomaOstia Half Marathon (21,097 km)\", \"price\": \"35.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/romaostia.it\/\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Meia Maratona de Roma (Roma-Ostia) 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 52\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o daRomaOstia Half Marathonrealiza-se no domingo,28 de fevereiro de 2027, em Roma, It\u00e1lia. A concentra\u00e7\u00e3o no PalaEUR come\u00e7a \u00e0s 07:30 (com entrega de sacos de guarda-roupa at\u00e9 \u00e0s 07:45) e as partidas por ondas arrancam \u00e0s09:00rumo \u00e0 Rotonda de Ostia (Piazzale Cristoforo Colombo).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite (cut-off) e o perfil do percurso de 21,097 km?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O percurso de 21,097 km \u00e9 linear ao longo da Via Cristoforo Colombo, ligando o bairro do EUR ao Mar Tirreno. O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo \u00e9 de3h30, com duas barreiras hor\u00e1rias interm\u00e9dias: passagem aokm 10 at\u00e9 1h40e aokm 15 at\u00e9 2h30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es encerram a15 de fevereiro de 2027e evoluem por fases: 35,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 10\/11\/2026, 40,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 19\/01\/2027, 45,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 04\/02\/2027 e 50,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 15\/02\/2027. O valor inclui camisola oficial de corrida,gymbag, saco numerado para transporte de bagagem e dorsal com chip.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os requisitos para atletas portugueses e estrangeiros?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os atletas residentes fora de It\u00e1lia podem participar apresentando filia\u00e7\u00e3o numa federa\u00e7\u00e3o nacional afiliada \u00e0 World Athletics, Runcard FIDAL com certificado m\u00e9dico, ou de forma simplificada no regimeTur\u00edstico-Desportivo(cidad\u00e3os estrangeiros n\u00e3o federados), bastando assinar o termo de responsabilidade (liability waiver) e submeter documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde \u00e9 levantado o dorsal e quem organiza a prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento do dorsal epacco garadecorre exclusivamente nos dias anteriores \u00e0 prova na aldeiaCasa RomaOstia(n\u00e3o h\u00e1 entrega no domingo de manh\u00e3). O evento \u00e9 organizado peloGSBRun (Gruppo Sportivo Bancari Romani)e pelaRCS Sports & Events, sob a \u00e9gide da World Athletics e da FIDAL.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70398,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,41],"event_type_2":[627,1059],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-65829","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-roma-italia","event_type-corrida","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-europa","event_type_2-italia"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-meia-maratona-de-roma-roma-ostia.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http